{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rk7SfYbv6JAUzMYb6Vqu8B","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Pooled IRT 2PL+γ Calibration Report\n2\t\n3\t**Date**: 2026-05-16\n4\t**Experiment**: exp006 — Pooled RRF-IRT Calibration\n5\t**Server**: cqa1-21977 (CPU)\n6\t**Model**: 2PL+γ (contam_irt_2pl_gamma.stan)\n7\t\n8\t---\n9\t\n10\t## Pipeline Summary\n11\t\n12\t### Step 1: RRF Re-aggregation (exp003)\n13\t- **Signals**: s1_embedding, s2_minkpp, s4_selfcritique\n14\t- **Scales**: 0.5B, 1.5B, 3B (Qwen2.5 family)\n15\t- **RRF k**: 60\n16\t- **Output**: `exposure_scores.json` — 30 models × 3 benchmarks\n17\t- **Filtering**: ALPHA16_BLOCKLIST applied, DEPRECATED dirs skipped\n18\t\n19\t### Step 2: Pooled IRT Fitting (exp006)\n20\t- **Stan MCMC config**: 4 chains, 1000 warmup + 1000 sampling, adapt_delta=0.95, max_treedepth=12, seed=42\n21\t- **Item subsampling**: MAX_ITEMS=300 per benchmark\n22\t- **D045 exclusion**: 0.5B excluded from MMLU and ARC (N=16); all scales for GSM8K (N=24)\n23\t- **Exposure source**: RRF signal composite scores\n24\t\n25\t---\n26\t\n27\t## Main Results\n28\t\n29\t| Benchmark | N_models | N_items | γ̂ | 95% CI | CI excl. 0 | PPP | raw_MAE | cal_MAE | ΔMAE | R̂ | ESS | div |\n30\t|-----------|----------|---------|------|--------|------------|------|---------|---------|------|------|------|-----|\n31\t| MMLU | 16 | 300 | 0.6551 | [−0.4056, 1.7366] | No | 0.1920 | 0.0155 | 0.0070 | 0.0085 | 1.0069 | 1453 | 0 |\n32\t| ARC | 16 | 300 | 0.7269 | [0.0207, 1.4433] | **Yes** | 0.0030 | 0.0338 | 0.0201 | 0.0136 | 1.0072 | 1449 | 0 |\n33\t| GSM8K | 24 | 300 | 0.0639 | [−0.3636, 0.4902] | No | 0.5413 | 0.1694 | 0.0062 | 0.1632 | 1.0078 | 1313 | 0 |\n34\t\n35\t---\n36\t\n37\t## Diagnostics\n38\t\n39\tAll three benchmarks pass convergence checks:\n40\t- **R̂** < 1.01 for all (threshold: 1.05)\n41\t- **ESS** > 1300 for all (threshold: 400)\n42\t- **Divergences**: 0 across all benchmarks\n43\t- **PPP**: MMLU=0.192 (adequate), ARC=0.003 (marginal), GSM8K=0.541 (good)\n44\t\n45\t## Interpretation\n46\t\n47\t- **ARC**: Only benchmark where 95% CI excludes zero (γ̂=0.73, CI=[0.02, 1.44]), indicating statistically detectable contamination signal. Very low PPP (0.003) suggests the model fits data significantly differently from null.\n48\t- **MMLU**: Moderate γ̂=0.66 but wide CI crossing zero — contamination signal present but not statistically significant at 95% level. PPP=0.192 is acceptable.\n49\t- **GSM8K**: γ̂≈0 (0.064) with CI firmly crossing zero — no contamination signal detected despite largest sample (N=24). ΔMAE=0.163 is large, driven by IRT calibration improving raw accuracy prediction rather than contamination adjustment. PPP=0.541 indicates excellent model fit.\n50\t\n51\t## Output Files\n52\t\n53\t- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp006/pooled_irt_2pl_gamma_n16/pooled_rrf_irt_results.json`\n54\t- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp006/pooled_irt_2pl_gamma_n16/mmlu/irt_results.json`\n55\t- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp006/pooled_irt_2pl_gamma_n16/arc_challenge/irt_results.json`\n56\t- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp006/pooled_irt_2pl_gamma_n16/gsm8k/irt_results.json`\n57\t- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp003/rrf_full_3scales/exposure_scores.json`\n58\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89efc4bf-b4a8-4592-8628-12957d10d789","uuid":"f5789177-907f-44bf-9bf9-3a889a36abe8","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:11:09.128Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/exp006/report/pooled_irt_2pl_gamma_report_20260516.md","content":"# Pooled IRT 2PL+γ Calibration Report\n\n**Date**: 2026-05-16\n**Experiment**: exp006 — Pooled RRF-IRT Calibration\n**Server**: cqa1-21977 (CPU)\n**Model**: 2PL+γ (contam_irt_2pl_gamma.stan)\n\n---\n\n## Pipeline Summary\n\n### Step 1: RRF Re-aggregation (exp003)\n- **Signals**: s1_embedding, s2_minkpp, s4_selfcritique\n- **Scales**: 0.5B, 1.5B, 3B (Qwen2.5 family)\n- **RRF k**: 60\n- **Output**: `exposure_scores.json` — 30 models × 3 benchmarks\n- **Filtering**: ALPHA16_BLOCKLIST applied, DEPRECATED dirs skipped\n\n### Step 2: Pooled IRT Fitting (exp006)\n- **Stan MCMC config**: 4 chains, 1000 warmup + 1000 sampling, adapt_delta=0.95, max_treedepth=12, seed=42\n- **Item subsampling**: MAX_ITEMS=300 per benchmark\n- **D045 exclusion**: 0.5B excluded from MMLU and ARC (N=16); all scales for GSM8K (N=24)\n- **Exposure source**: RRF signal composite scores\n\n---\n\n## Main Results\n\n| Benchmark | N_models | N_items | γ̂ | 95% CI | CI excl. 0 | PPP | raw_MAE | cal_MAE | ΔMAE | R̂ | ESS | div |\n|-----------|----------|---------|------|--------|------------|------|---------|---------|------|------|------|-----|\n| MMLU | 16 | 300 | 0.6551 | [−0.4056, 1.7366] | No | 0.1920 | 0.0155 | 0.0070 | 0.0085 | 1.0069 | 1453 | 0 |\n| ARC | 16 | 300 | 0.7269 | [0.0207, 1.4433] | **Yes** | 0.0030 | 0.0338 | 0.0201 | 0.0136 | 1.0072 | 1449 | 0 |\n| GSM8K | 24 | 300 | 0.0639 | [−0.3636, 0.4902] | No | 0.5413 | 0.1694 | 0.0062 | 0.1632 | 1.0078 | 1313 | 0 |\n\n---\n\n## Diagnostics\n\nAll three benchmarks pass convergence checks:\n- **R̂** < 1.01 for all (threshold: 1.05)\n- **ESS** > 1300 for all (threshold: 400)\n- **Divergences**: 0 across all benchmarks\n- **PPP**: MMLU=0.192 (adequate), ARC=0.003 (marginal), GSM8K=0.541 (good)\n\n## Interpretation\n\n- **ARC**: Only benchmark where 95% CI excludes zero (γ̂=0.73, CI=[0.02, 1.44]), indicating statistically detectable contamination signal. Very low PPP (0.003) suggests the model fits data significantly differently from null.\n- **MMLU**: Moderate γ̂=0.66 but wide CI crossing zero — contamination signal present but not statistically significant at 95% level. PPP=0.192 is acceptable.\n- **GSM8K**: γ̂≈0 (0.064) with CI firmly crossing zero — no contamination signal detected despite largest sample (N=24). ΔMAE=0.163 is large, driven by IRT calibration improving raw accuracy prediction rather than contamination adjustment. PPP=0.541 indicates excellent model fit.\n\n## Output Files\n\n- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp006/pooled_irt_2pl_gamma_n16/pooled_rrf_irt_results.json`\n- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp006/pooled_irt_2pl_gamma_n16/mmlu/irt_results.json`\n- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp006/pooled_irt_2pl_gamma_n16/arc_challenge/irt_results.json`\n- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp006/pooled_irt_2pl_gamma_n16/gsm8k/irt_results.json`\n- `/root/autodl-tmp/exp003/rrf_full_3scales/exposure_scores.json`\n","numLines":58,"startLine":1,"totalLines":58}}}
